  "title": "Google AI Edge Foresight App Transcribes Meetings Offline",
  "summary": "Google has released an experimental AI note-taking app, Google AI Edge Foresight, that transcribes meetings and audio files completely offline, marking a shift toward on-device AI capabilities. The app runs on macOS and uses the company's EmbeddingGemma 2 model, similar to apps like Granola and Wispr Flow.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Google AI Edge Foresight is an experimental note-taking app that transcribes meetings and audio files entirely offline.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The app runs on macOS and uses the company's on-device EmbeddingGemma 2 model.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Google has shared that the app is free to use and is designed to work without an internet connection.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
